  <summary>&lt;p>Play videos on your desktop/lock screen with pause with active window, blur, screen off/battery saving and more.&lt;br />&lt;br />Based on &lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1316299">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://store.kde.org/p/1316299">https://store.kde.org/p/1316299&lt;/a> fixed and rewritten for plasma 6&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;b>Features&lt;/b>&lt;br />&lt;/p>&lt;ul>&lt;li> Play a single video or slideshow of videos&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Enable/disable video sound&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Lock screen support&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Pause Video conditions&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Maximized/fullscreen, active, present window, screen off/locked&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Desktop Effects&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;br /> Blur&lt;br />&lt;ul>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Conditions&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Maximized/fullscreen, active, present window, video is paused&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Desktop Effects&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Radius&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;br /> Battery saving&lt;br />&lt;ul>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Pauses video&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> -&amp;gt; Disable Blur&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;b>Support the development ❤️&lt;/b>&lt;br />&lt;br />&lt;ul>&lt;li> GitHub Sponsors &lt;a href="https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra">https://github.com/sponsors/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Ko-fi &lt;a href="https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra">https://ko-fi.com/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> Buy Me A Coffee &lt;a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra">https://www.buymeacoffee.com/luisbocanegra&lt;/a>&lt;br />&lt;/li>&lt;li> PayPal &lt;a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Y5TMH3Z4YZRDA">&lt;/a>&lt;a href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=Y5TMH3Z4YZRDA">ht